    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no jam for dinner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Grandparaffine requests Bulb Boy to venture into the eerie depths of the basement to retrieve a jar that holds the key to a delightful meal.  As Bulb Boy navigates through the dark, shadowy corners of the cellar, he must face sticky jelly creatures and their spine-tingling boss that wants Bulb Boy's head for his own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717400/extras/10205d5daca7c75d9146fcfe4e42fe1c.poster.avif?t=1753387953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717400/extras/10205d5daca7c75d9146fcfe4e42fe1c.webm?t=1753387953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717400/extras/10205d5daca7c75d9146fcfe4e42fe1c.mp4?t=1753387953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The second part of the game from the creators of the award-winning Bulb Boy. This time, in color!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vibrant style of 90s cartoons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gotesque jelly monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close-ups on disgusting details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control with pad / keyboard / mouse - autoresponsive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
